   "fieldname": "html_znbo",
   "fieldtype": "HTML",
   "options": "<div style=\"max-width:900px; margin:20px auto; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n\n    <h2 style=\"text-align:center; margin-bottom:20px; color:#111827;\">\n        How to Check Laptop System Information\n    </h2>\n\n    <div style=\"display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n\n        <!-- Windows Section -->\n        <div style=\"flex:1; min-width:300px; border:1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; background:#f9fafb; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\n\n            <h3 style=\"margin-top:0; color:#2563eb;\">Windows</h3>\n\n            <ol style=\"font-size:15px; line-height:1.8; color:#374151;\">\n                <li>\n                    Press \n                    <span style=\"background:#e5e7eb; padding:3px 8px; border-radius:6px;\">\n                        Windows + R\n                    </span>\n                </li>\n\n                <li>\n                    Type \n                    <span style=\"background:#e5e7eb; padding:3px 8px; border-radius:6px;\">\n                        msinfo32\n                    </span>\n                </li>\n\n                <li>\n                    Press \n                    <span style=\"background:#e5e7eb; padding:3px 8px; border-radius:6px;\">\n                        Enter\n                    </span>\n                </li>\n            </ol>\n\n            <div style=\"margin-top:10px; font-size:14px; background:#eef6ff; padding:10px; border-left:4px solid #2563eb; border-radius:6px;\">\n                This will open the <b>System Information</b> window showing full laptop details.\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Mac Section -->\n        <div style=\"flex:1; min-width:300px; border:1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; background:#f9fafb; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);\">\n\n            <h3 style=\"margin-top:0; color:#111827;\">Mac</h3>\n\n            <ol style=\"font-size:15px; line-height:1.8; color:#374151;\">\n                <li>\n                    Click the \n                    <span style=\"background:#e5e7eb; padding:3px 8px; border-radius:6px;\">\n                        Apple logo (\uf8ff)\n                    </span> \n                    in the top-left corner.\n                </li>\n\n                <li>\n                    Click \n                    <span style=\"background:#e5e7eb; padding:3px 8px; border-radius:6px;\">\n                        About This Mac\n                    </span>\n                </li>\n            </ol>\n\n            <div style=\"margin-top:10px; font-size:14px; background:#eef6ff; padding:10px; border-left:4px solid #2563eb; border-radius:6px;\">\n                This will display your Mac's hardware information including processor, memory, and macOS version.\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n</div>"
